> Josh Knarr wrote:[Thu Feb 27 2003, 10:18:00PM EST]
> > I finally figured out that the EV56 directive in GCC is broken, which is
> > why both my alphas were getting killed.  This is not in the docs?
> 
> Interesting!  I didn't know about that.  All my machines are EV6 or
> better...  ;-)
